About page offers the Corresponding Source (AGPL-3.0 s13) and keeps the upstream copyright; its two links come from
custom.txt (protech-website-url / protech-source-url) with compiled-in fallbacks.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
